{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/6f149859385b756c33fc33ed7e3f71ce.avif?t=1762266499\" width=616 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squidly wasn\u2019t a hero. He was just a squishy little reef-dweller with more heart than muscle. But when Lord Azure and his Abyssal Cult started dragging folks into the deep and wrecking his home, even a squid has his limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then Poseidon \u2014 ancient sea god, part-time drama queen \u2014 blessed him with divine power and one mission: get revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/f97724af9a979a2c028a292135f7d074.poster.avif?t=1762266499\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/f97724af9a979a2c028a292135f7d074.webm?t=1762266499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in this <strong>fast-paced underwater roguelike</strong>, Squidly fights back using whatever weapons his enemies drop \u2014 from mantis shrimp knuckle dusters to barnacle blasters. <strong>Every run is randomized</strong>, chaotic, and packed with cartoon mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.poster.avif?t=1762266499\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.webm?t=1762266499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.mp4?t=1762266499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive waves of enemies</strong>, <strong>steal their gear</strong>, and take on the ocean's deadliest bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s underqualified. He\u2019s overpowered. He\u2019s out for revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Squidly\u2019s Revenge</i> \u2014 a deep-sea brawl for the ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge powerful bosses, defeat them for their power that shift your play style as you grow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of enemies and bosses till the very end\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate run modifiers that ramp up difficulty - and the rewards. Mix and match to tailor the perfect run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn permanent upgrades between runs\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same - randomized bosses and enemies to keep you on your toes (tentacles?)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854780?t=1762266499","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854780?t=1762266499","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/b66acee97d6b5382cf770b4e312f994357f9b201/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762266499","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/b66acee97d6b5382cf770b4e312f994357f9b201/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762266499","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4025680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/6f149859385b756c33fc33ed7e3f71ce.avif?t=1762266499\" width=616 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squidly wasn\u2019t a hero. He was just a squishy little reef-dweller with more heart than muscle. But when Lord Azure and his Abyssal Cult started dragging folks into the deep and wrecking his home, even a squid has his limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then Poseidon \u2014 ancient sea god, part-time drama queen \u2014 blessed him with divine power and one mission: get revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/f97724af9a979a2c028a292135f7d074.poster.avif?t=1762266499\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/f97724af9a979a2c028a292135f7d074.webm?t=1762266499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in this <strong>fast-paced underwater roguelike</strong>, Squidly fights back using whatever weapons his enemies drop \u2014 from mantis shrimp knuckle dusters to barnacle blasters. <strong>Every run is randomized</strong>, chaotic, and packed with cartoon mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.poster.avif?t=1762266499\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.webm?t=1762266499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.mp4?t=1762266499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive waves of enemies</strong>, <strong>steal their gear</strong>, and take on the ocean's deadliest bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s underqualified. He\u2019s overpowered. He\u2019s out for revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Squidly\u2019s Revenge</i> \u2014 a deep-sea brawl for the ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge powerful bosses, defeat them for their power that shift your play style as you grow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of enemies and bosses till the very end\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate run modifiers that ramp up difficulty - and the rewards. Mix and match to tailor the perfect run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn permanent upgrades between runs\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same - randomized bosses and enemies to keep you on your toes (tentacles?)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Howling Wolf Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/42033973baacad20b8453b9481083ed4d4d48e84/header.jpg?t=1762266499","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854780/1026308243/30e57cb42e0060b607a798aaa7ae8fd53a864e1c/1752864321/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753364843","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854780/1026308243/30e57cb42e0060b607a798aaa7ae8fd53a864e1c/1752864321/da